#: ../../tools/biotools_registry_tools.rst:66 9ae889cff2ab4626b6bf93e11ffba509
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the ELIXIR Bio.tools registry for bioinformatics "
"software tools, databases, and web services. Bio.tools is the "
"comprehensive registry of bioinformatics resources maintained by ELIXIR, "
"containing 30,000+ entries. Returns tool names, descriptions, types, "
"topics, and homepages. Use this to find software for specific "
"bioinformatics tasks (e.g., 'sequence alignment', 'variant calling', "
"'protein structure prediction'). Example: search 'RNA-seq' to find RNA "
"sequencing analysis tools."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biotools_registry_tools.rst:70 069a9aa0f37343f088b559532a68f160
msgid ""
"``q`` (string) (required) Free-text search query. Searches across tool "
"names, descriptions, and topics. Examples: 'blast', 'RNA-seq analysis', "
"'protein folding', 'variant calling', 'metagenomics'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biotools_registry_tools.rst:73 7f2ff3a0d85645c5801b4e51f22b2f09
msgid ""
"``page`` (integer) (optional) Page number for paginated results "
"(1-based). Default: 1."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biotools_registry_tools.rst:76 f70cca23f413492bb63b822ccdebd5f3
msgid ""
"``size`` (integer) (optional) Number of results per page (1-50). Default:"
" 10."
